{
  "uid": "n360-customer",
  "title": "N360 \u00b7 Customer",
  "tags": [
    "n360"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-90d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "account",
        "label": "Customer",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
          "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
        },
        "query": "SELECT account, display_name FROM n360.account ORDER BY display_name",
        "definition": "SELECT account, display_name FROM n360.account ORDER BY display_name",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Data through",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Last day included in this load (the nightly window ends at 23:59 UTC that day).\n\n**Source:** n360.runs, written by load.py only after every data check passes  \n**Filter:** loaded runs only; the latest  \n**Window:** the latest load",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT formatDateTime(window_end, '%e %b %Y') AS data_through\n        FROM n360.runs WHERE status = 'loaded' ORDER BY loaded_at DESC LIMIT 1",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Pipeline health",
              "url": "/d/n360-pipeline?${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Last night",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Result of the latest nightly run. A stopped night leaves the previous good night on screen.\n\n**Source:** n360.runs (load.py writes one row per night, loaded or not)  \n**Filter:** none  \n**Window:** the latest run",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT toString(status) AS status FROM n360.runs ORDER BY loaded_at DESC LIMIT 1",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "loaded": {
                  "text": "Loaded",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "failed_checks": {
                  "text": "Stopped: data checks failed",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Contract lines",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Contract lines on the entitlement sheet for this customer, and how many have no usage to show: not implemented (contracted, nothing built) or not measurable (unit the platform does not count).\n\n**Source:** n360.contract_line  \n**Filter:** Customer  \n**Window:** the latest load",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT count() AS `Contract lines`, countIf(measure = 'not implemented') AS `Not implemented`,\n               countIf(measure = 'not measurable') AS `Not measurable`\n        FROM n360.contract_line WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 12,
          "valueSize": 26
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Anomalies, 7 settled days",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "VA-days flagged on the 7 newest settled days, and flags on the newest 3 days (provisional: may still change, never an alert).\n\n**Source:** n360.v_va_day_anomaly via n360.v_customer_attention  \n**Filter:** Customer  \n**Window:** the 7 newest settled days; provisional = the newest 3 days",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT drops_silences_7d AS `Drops or silences`, spikes_7d AS Spikes, provisional_flags AS Provisional\n        FROM n360.v_customer_attention WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 12,
          "valueSize": 26
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Worst line",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "The most off-pace line or pool (red, then amber, then the larger pace gap), in its own measure.\n\n**Source:** n360.v_customer_attention (from n360.v_line_pace)  \n**Filter:** Customer  \n**Window:** start date to the data-through day",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT if(worst_entitlement = 'pool', 'Pooled entitlement', worst_label) AS Line, pct_billed AS `% of billed`, pct_term AS `% of term`, pace AS Pace\n        FROM n360.v_customer_attention WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "% of billed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "% of term"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Pace"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "red": {
                        "text": "Red",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "amber": {
                        "text": "Amber",
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "green": {
                        "text": "Green",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "not measurable": {
                        "text": "Not measurable",
                        "color": "#8e8e8e",
                        "index": 3
                      },
                      "not implemented": {
                        "text": "Not implemented",
                        "color": "#8e8e8e",
                        "index": 4
                      },
                      "not read": {
                        "text": "Not reported yet",
                        "color": "#8e8e8e",
                        "index": 5
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 12,
          "valueSize": 18
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Total used against billed",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Used against billed across this customer's lines and pools, only when they share one measure and one term (rules 2 and 5): never across different measures or contracts. Not implemented, not measurable and unread lines are left out. A pool counts once.\n\n**Source:** n360.v_line_pace  \n**Filter:** Customer; lines and pools with a % of billed  \n**Window:** start date to the data-through day",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT if(same, sum(used), NULL) AS Used, if(same, sum(billed), NULL) AS Billed,\n               if(same, round(100 * sum(used) / sum(billed), 1), NULL) AS `% of billed`,\n               if(same, any(measure), 'Not added up: lines differ in measure or term') AS Measure\n        FROM (SELECT *, (SELECT uniqExact(measure, start_date, end_date) = 1 FROM n360.v_line_pace\n                         WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote}) AND pct_billed IS NOT NULL) AS same\n              FROM n360.v_line_pace WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote}) AND pct_billed IS NOT NULL)\n        GROUP BY same",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not added up"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Used"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "locale"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Billed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "locale"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "% of billed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 12,
          "valueSize": 18
        }
      },
      "n360MayBeEmpty": "a customer with no measured line"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Main line, last 30 days",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "The line or pool with the most use: its rate per day over the last 30 days (the stored forecast's rate), and whether that rate is a step change from its term average (more than 50% different, flagged upstream).\n\n**Source:** n360.forecast via n360.v_line_pace  \n**Filter:** Customer  \n**Window:** last 30 days to the data-through day",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT argMax(if(entitlement = 'pool', 'Pooled entitlement', label), used) AS Line, argMax(round(rate_per_day), used) AS `Per day`,\n               argMax(ifNull(step_change, 'none'), used) AS `Step change`\n        FROM n360.v_line_pace WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote}) AND rate_per_day IS NOT NULL",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Per day"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "locale"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 12,
          "valueSize": 18
        }
      },
      "n360MayBeEmpty": "a customer with no forecast"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Contract lines",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Every contract line not in a pool, in its own measure. A not implemented or not measurable line shows grey and \"Not reported yet\": it has no usage, never zero. Forecast to horizon and Runs out are the stored forecast (straight line at the last-30-day rate). Click a line to open it.\n\n**Source:** n360.v_line_pace (n360.v_line_status, n360.forecast)  \n**Filter:** Customer; lines not in a pool (pools below)  \n**Window:** start date to the data-through day; forecast to its horizon",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT label AS Line, measure AS Measure, used AS Used, billed AS Billed, pct_billed AS `% of billed`,\n               pace AS Pace, pct_term AS `% of term`, forecast_m3 AS `Forecast to horizon`,\n               multiIf(exhaust_date IS NOT NULL, concat(toString(toDayOfMonth(exhaust_date)), ' ', formatDateTime(exhaust_date, '%b %Y')), pct_billed > 100, 'Already above billed', NULL) AS `Runs out`,\n               concat('/d/n360-line?var-account=', account, '&var-line=', line_key) AS drill\n        FROM n360.v_line_pace WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote}) AND entitlement = 'line'\n        ORDER BY pace_rank DESC, label",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "All lines are pooled: see Pooled entitlement below",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "drill"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Used"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "locale"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Billed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "locale"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Forecast to horizon"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "locale"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "% of billed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "% of term"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Pace"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "red": {
                        "text": "Red",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "amber": {
                        "text": "Amber",
                        "color": "orange",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "green": {
                        "text": "Green",
                        "color": "green",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "not measurable": {
                        "text": "Not measurable",
                        "color": "#8e8e8e",
                        "index": 3
                      },
                      "not implemented": {
                        "text": "Not implemented",
                        "color": "#8e8e8e",
                        "index": 4
                      },
                      "not read": {
                        "text": "Not reported yet",
                        "color": "#8e8e8e",
                        "index": 5
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "special",
                    "options": {
